  "body": "10 Year Master Builders Guarantee\r\n\r\nFantastic, stunning elevated water views capture all-day sun. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a sun drenched deck and landscaped gardens – ideal for BBQs and gatherings. Brand new and immaculate, this home is ready for you to move in. Every detail was thoughtfully considered for modern living. \r\n\r\nFour expansive family rooms offer multiple zones for relaxation and entertainment, with open-plan living areas designed for comfort and connectivity. Modern designer kitchens feature ample pantry space, perfect for family meals and entertaining. Four spacious double bedrooms offer plenty of room for the whole family, and there are 3.5 beautifully appointed bathrooms, including two luxurious master ensuites on different levels. Versatile layout to suit every family. The downstairs area features one generous living space with separate entries – ideal for working from home, extended family, teenagers, or home-stays. This flexible area adapts effortlessly to your lifestyle needs.    \r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned between the Silverdale Shopping Centre, beautiful Orewa Beach and the Whangaparaoa Peninsula with all of the surrounding amenities. Enjoy easy motorway access, just a few minutes' drive to the Silverdale/Millwater centre, Orewa town centre and beach and Albany. It is also in close to high decile schools and motorway on/off ramps. With public transport just across the road, this location couldn't be better. \r\n\r\nHere is a fantastic coastal family home ready for move in and enjoy the generous spaces, solid construction, and a flat, private garden that make this property truly special.",
